<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Simpson Manufacturing.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Simpson Manufacturing.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co analyst Keith Dunne raised his earnings estimates for Simpson Manufacturing Co following the company's report Tuesday of a second quarter profit of $0.59 a share versus $0.44 last year.</p>
<p>-- raised his 1997 estimate to $2.10 a share from $1.95 and raised his 1998 estimate to $2.45 a share from $2.25.</p>
<p>-- said the company &quot;continues to outperform market expectations.</p>
<p>-- Simpson makes steel connectors used in residential and light commercial construction.</p>
</text>
